<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  RealEarth does not replace the full vanilla biomes.xml by default (too version-fragile).
  Landcover → biome mapping is applied when painting biomes.png / at stream time.

  Mapping (see tools/realearth/landcover.py):
    forest/grass/crop/urban underlay → pine_forest
    desert/shrub → desert
    snow/ice → snow
    barren → wasteland
    ocean/inland_water → water
-->
<RealEarthBiomesNote>
  Use export biomes.png with a heightmap importer, or runtime TileStreamer landcover.
</RealEarthBiomesNote>
